Package: mcp-server-magento
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nodejs (>= 18),
 hicolor-icon-theme,
Description: MCP server for Magento 2 product, order and revenue queries
 A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets LLMs query a Magento 2
 store over its REST API: products, stock, categories, orders, revenue
 and customer purchases, plus an optional product attribute update that
 can be disabled with MAGENTO_READ_ONLY=true.
 .
 This package vendors its production npm dependencies under
 /usr/share/mcp-server-magento, as they are not available in the Debian
 archive.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-magento
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-magento (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Magento 2 MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-magento. Installing it registers the
 mcp-server-magento binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
